  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "You are a small worm, stuck in a time/space loop. The loop was supposed to end in a minute, but weird time artifacts (and some weirder time-bugs) keep appearing, and whenever you collide with them the time loop lasts longer. To make things worse the strange physics of the loop makes you run faster near the end. Try dodging everything and eventually you'll be free!"
    }
  ],
